  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫だ。三次審査、ちゃんと通ってたぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001050020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……はぁーっ、ドキドキした……！\r\nもう、心臓に悪いよ……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700105/7007001050020",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "珍しく心配してたんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001050030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "まぁ、三峰なりに思うところはあったっていうか、ね",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700105/7007001050030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001050040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "正直に言えば、すごくホッとしてるよ\r\nなんとかなって良かったって",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700105/7007001050040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001050050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……でもさ、ここで満足なんてしてられないよね\r\nここまで来たら、絶対『W.I.N.G.』に出てやらないと",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700105/7007001050050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001050060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "…………私が、ちゃんとしたアイドルになれるように",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700105/7007001050060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだな\r\n次の審査に向けて、気を引き締めないとだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001050070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "うん。うっかり気を抜いてダメになったら\r\n目も当てられないし",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700105/7007001050070",
    "charAnim3Loop": false
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001050080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "よしっ！　三峰、ここからまた仕切り直すよ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700105/7007001050080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001050090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "見ててねプロデューサー\r\n『W.I.N.G.』への切符、取ってきちゃうからっ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700105/7007001050090"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001050100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そしてもちろん、その先の優勝までかっさらってくるよ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
